1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
The first airplane flight was shorter than the wings of a jumbo jet.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
It's 1903, two brothers from Ohio fix bicycles.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
They dream of building a flying machine.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Everyone says it's impossible.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
One famous inventor's plane falls into a river.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
So the brothers build a wind tunnel, a box with a fan,

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
and test over 200 tiny wings.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Here's the secret.

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Stick your hand out of a car window and tilt it up.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The air pushes it up. That push is called lift.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
A wing works the same way, just much bigger.

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
In December, they take their plane to a windy beach.

13
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
They flip a coin to see who flies first.

14
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Wilbur wins and three seconds later crashes into the sand.

15
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Three days later, it's Orville's turn.

16
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:53,000
He lies on the wing, the engine roars, and the plane lifts off.

17
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
12 seconds, 37 meters.

18
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Luckily, that was enough to change the world.

19
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:03,000
And luckily, a gust of wind flipped the plane that same day.

20
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
It never flew again.

21
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Today, a jumbo jet's wings are longer than that whole flight.

22
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,000
And Wilbur, he made the longest flight that day.

23
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
59 seconds, not bad for the brother who crashed first.
